{"sourceUrl":"https://bme.sysu.edu.cn/noticezs/1422013.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:03:36.155262+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://bme.sysu.edu.cn/noticezs/1422013.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><span><span><span><span>根据学校和企业联合培养工程硕博专项的工作要求，现将本院招收校企联培专项研究生的相关事项通知如下：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    <span>一、</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>招生计划</span></span></span></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>专业</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>专项计划</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>全日制</span></span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>合作企业</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>领域</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>校内导师</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>085409</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>生物医学工程</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>硕士</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>中国联通</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>联通数智医疗科技有限公司</span></span><span><span>)</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>人工智能</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>  待定</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>085409</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>生物医学工程</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>博士</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>直博生</span></span><span><span>1</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>广州国家实验室</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>生物医药及高端医疗设备</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>宋嵘</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>085409</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>生物医学工程</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>博士</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>直博生</span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>京津冀国家技术创新中心</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>生物医药及高端医疗设备</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>蒋乐伦、高智凡</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>085409</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>生物医学工程</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>博士</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>直博生</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>粤港澳大湾区国家技术创新中心</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>生物医药及高端医疗设备</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>蒋乐伦</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    <span>二、招生对象</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>目前在中山大学取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生（含获得中山大学工程硕博专项推免资格的同学）。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    <span>三、报名条件</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领导，道德品行良好，遵纪守法，身心健康；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，未受过任何处分；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>在中山大学取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格，对学术研究兴趣浓厚，具有较强的创新意识、创新能力，有作为博士、硕士研究生培养的潜质；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>身体健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>入学前须本科毕业并获得学士学位；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    <span>四、报名方式</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>符合条件的申请人准备好申请材料</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>按预推免第二批报名相关要求</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>请登录报名网址（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>https://enroll.sysu.edu.cn/</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）进行报名</span><span>:预推免-中山大学生物医学工程学院202</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年校企联培工程硕博专项研究生报名</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>报名截止时间：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>中午</span><span>12：00</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>前，过期视为无效。原件请妥善保存，待面试时再行提交。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    <span>五、复试安排</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>我院将根据工作安排，与合作企业共同对成功报名的申请人材料进行初审后，择优确定拟面试名单，预计于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日组织面试</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>如有调整待后续通知</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。具体面试安排请留意通知。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    <span>六、其他事项</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>附件说明</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>工程硕博士培养改革专项简介</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>请见附件</span><span>1。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>相关企业的介绍请联系梁老师</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>进入复试的同学需提供的知情同意书，详见附件</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>中山大学生物医学工程学院接收</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年推荐免试生攻读研究生申请表，详见附件</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>联系方式</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>联系人：中山大学生物医学工程学院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>梁</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>老师</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>地址：深圳市光明区中山大学医学园</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>栋</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>3A</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>办公室</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>电话：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>0755-23260140</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>bmeyjs@mail.sysu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>生物医学工程学院</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>附件1：</span></span></span></span><a href=\"https://bme.sysu.edu.cn/docs/20260917103759912113.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>工程硕博士培养改革专项简介 </span></a></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>附件2：</span></span></span></span><a href=\"https://bme.sysu.edu.cn/docs/20260917103814727224.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>专项推免拟录取考生知情同意书</span></a></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>附件3：</span></span></span></span><a href=\"https://bme.sysu.edu.cn/docs/20260917103834710330.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span><span>中山大学生物医学工程学院接收</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年推荐免试生攻读研究生申请表</span></span></span></span></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","textSha256":"0c2c76e995c8dfd60a4e45d0be9d72ec4a5ab733f1efdbf494810b2c66482e19","textLength":1024,"sourceSha256":"4e99ee7791f10a4aac4169febac65a251fe95c79a8dc075f62961b3b557bdcf4","selector":".cont","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-405b52c9236dd2f4b4e0","title":"2026年中山大学生物医学工程学院关于招收2027年校企联培工程硕博专项研究生的报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:03:36.155262+00:00"}
